{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "No worries. I'm just glad those goofballs finally cleaned up their act. Now you can make your mochi in peace.": "",
  "Thanks to you, at any rate.": "",
  "Well, I must start preparations for tomorrow, so I hope to see you again. Please take care.": "",
  "(Oh hey, it's Tsukumo.)": "",
  "Sorry to bug, but I kinda need to ask a small favor.": "",
  "(Ebisu... He must mean the pawn shop. That's not too far.)": "",
  "(Tsukumo's always helping me out, so I do owe him one. Poor guy has never felt comfortable outdoors.)": "",
  "(I think this is what Tsukumo wanted. But how'd he even know a pawn shop would have it!?)": "",
  "(Well, guess I'll go make the hand-off.)": "",
  "I brought you the goods. It is this one, right?": "",
  "Yup, that's the one! Many thanks. How much was it?": "",
  "No worries. Though, wouldn't it have been quicker to go yourself?": "",
  "What can I say, I'm a busy guy.": "",
  "Plus there's this preorder about to open up, so it's time to man the battle stations.": "",
  "Ha, you've always got a reason to stay cooped up, huh? You never change.": "",
  "Nah, I shouldn't say that. You've improved a lot, actually.": "",
  "It's all thanks to you, Yagami-shi.": "",
  "I might never have made human contact again if it weren't for you reaching out to me.": "",
  "True. You always have been a big help, that's for sure.": "",
  "Either way, I'm lucky to have you.": "",
  "Hehe, right back at you!": "",
  "Nah, it's on me. I'm paying you back for last time, remember?": "",
  "Really? Hey, that's pretty generous of you.": "",
  "Yeah, speaking of which...": "",
  "You finally set foot out of your house, only to end up hiding away in a net café?": "",
  "Heh, well, the rent's cheap and the internet's fast. What more could you want in life?": "",
  "Besides... this is the perfect place for an informant to set up his base of operations.": "",
  "Mmm, compliments to the chef!": "",
  "Seriously, your chashu was incredible.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Glad to hear it!": "",
  "A lot of people compliment our ramen, but to be honest, not too many people mention our chashu.": "",
  "Huh. Wonder why.": "",
  "It's the strangest thing. We put just as much effort into our chashu as we do our ramen.": "",
  "That's probably why it tastes so good.": "",
  "Hah, then I'll let you in on a secret. We do add a special little ingredient that you probably wouldn't expect.": "",
  "Oh? And what would that be?": "",
  "Take a wild guess.": "",
  "Hmm... Can I get a hint?": "",
  "Haha, alright then. Let's see...": "",
  "Normally you'd add sugar to sweeten up chashu, but here we use something else. What do you think that could be?": "",
  "A substitute for sugar, huh...": "",
  "Mayonnaise?": "",
  "High fructose corn syrup?": "",
  "MSG?": "",
  "Nope! Not even close.": "",
  "The correct answer... is honey.": "",
  "Honey?": "",
  "Aha! You must have quite the refined palate to figure that one out.": "",
  "With the right amount of honey, you can make nearly any cut of meat drip with sweet, tender goodness.": "",
  "I see. Now that you mention it, that chashu <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> dripping with sweet, tender goodness.": "",
  "Hahaha, indeed! Say... what's your name?": "",
  "I'm Yagami. It's nice to meet you.": "",
  "Yagami-san, huh? The pleasure's all mine. Hope to see you around more often!": "",
  "You bet! See you next time.": "",
  "Meh, this place was whatever. The food wasn't bad, but the presentation? Lame.": "",
  "Yeah... It's like they <font_kind=yakuza_italic>tried</font_kind> to make it look boring. Totally not Chatter-worthy at all. Wouldn't even make a decent meme.": "",
  "Why don't we get outta here and grab some dessert?": "",
  "For sure. Let's go hit up Mijore.": "",
  "(...What was all that about?)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san... C'mon in.": "",
  "Everything okay? You don't seem like your usual self.": "",
  "Huh? Ah, it's nothing, really...": "",
  "Well, in all honesty... I realized our ramen hasn't caught on with the younger crowd. And I can't put my finger on why.": "",
  "That is a head-scratcher for sure. Personally I think your ramen tastes amazing.": "",
  "You're too kind, Yagami-san. I wish it were as simple as taste, but that's not all young people are after these days.": "",
  "It's this whole social media thing.": "",
  "Kids nowadays are hooked on it! Everything they see and do, they'll snap a picture and share with the entire world.": "",
  "Yeah, sounds about right.": "",
  "Unfortunately, our ramen isn't quite suited for this online environment because we make it simple and traditional.": "",
  "I see... Guess it's a sign of the times.": "",
  "And it kills me when customers crowd around a spot just because they make a smiley face out of the fish eggs or something.": "",
  "But taste always wins in the end, right?": "",
  "Of course I know that. But... it's just...": "",
  "Then why don't you try concocting something fancy of your own?": "",
  "Why don't you cook up a hot new ramen designed to catch people's attention?": "",
  "Hmm. You make a decent argument, but I feel it's almost a sin to attract customers based on visual appeal alone...": "",
  "Yes, so why not create a ramen that both looks <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> tastes appealing?": "",
  "For example, how about a ramen topped with your honey-marinated chashu?": "",
  "That way, you'll be using your tried-and-true ingredients in a more innovative way.": "",
  "A specially crafted ramen... that accentuates both form and flavor...": "",
  "...Yeah. Yeah! You know what, I can do that!": "",
  "That's the spirit! I know you've got what it takes to make the trendiest ramen in town.": "",
  "Roger that! I'll get right to work!": "",
  "Mm, can't wait!": "",
  "Whoa, that chashu ramen practically melted in my mouth!": "",
  "For real... I dunno what they put in there, but it totally blew my mind!": "",
  "I know right!?": "",
  "Better post this up before someone beats me to it.": "",
  "Yeah! That pic's gonna blow up for sure!": "",
  "(Are those the kids from before?)": "",
  "(Geez, they just made a complete 180. And, by the way, it's honey that the chef put in there.)": "",
  "(But, judging from their reaction, that means...)": "",
  "Welcome! Why, if it isn't good ol' Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey. So I see you've added something to the menu.": "",
  "Yep, I call it the Crushin' Chashu Challenge! It's a super-sized ramen with no leftovers allowed!": "",
  "Ohh, nice!": "",
  "Thanks to that, we have a lot of youngsters stopping by.": "",
  "Though they do keep taking photos instead of eating right away...\nI suppose that's good for business! Hahaha!": "",
  "That's really good to hear.": "",
  "And I owe it all to you, Yagami-san! Thanks a bunch!": "",
  "Hey now, don't forget your ramen has always tasted great. You should be getting a lot of customers.": "",
  "Heh, you always seem to have something positive to say. Hope my new ramen will have you singing its praises as well.": "",
  "Well, there's only one way to find out!": "",
  "(I'm glad he's back to his old self, now that everyone appreciates his cuisine. Can't wait to try it myself.)": "",
  "Damn... I can't frickin' believe this! What kind of two-bit dump has the balls to refuse its customers, anyway!?": "",
  "(...What was up with that guy?)": "",
  "Greetings, sir. I'm Matsuzaki, the manager here. Would you care to learn about our yakiniku challenge?": "",
  "Sure, what's it all about?": "",
  "It's got three trivia questions related to yakiniku. Answer them right and we'll serve you the finest kalbi Kamurocho has to offer!": "",
  "Hmm. Sounds interesting.": "",
  "A worthy morsel for a worthy customer... Will your knowledge make the grade? Or will you end up getting grilled?": "",
  "Find out for only 1,000 yen!": "",
  "(Should I take the yakiniku challenge?)": "",
  "No, I'm fine. I'm here for the regular stuff today.": "",
  "Very well, then. May I take your order?": "",
  "Oh? I'm afraid you don't have enough money, sir.": "",
  "Oh, whoops...": "",
  "(I'll come back some other time.)": "",
  "I'll give this thing a shot.": "",
  "Wonderful! Then let's begin right away.": "",
  "First question:": "",
  "Which of the following innards is located toward the rearmost part of the cow?": "",
  "The large intestine, right?": "",
  "The kidneys, right?": "",
  "The liver, right?": "",
  "The small intestine, right?": "",
  "Bravo! You nailed it!": "",
  "Awesome!": "",
  "Now then, onto the second question:": "",
  "Which of the following innards is considered to be the \"guts\"?": "",
  "The large intestine?": "",
  "The heart?": "",
  "The liver?": "",
  "The stomach?": "",
  "Amazing! You're absolutely right!": "",
  "Next is the third and final question:": "",
  "Which of the following cuts is used to prepare kalbi?": "",
  "Is it the tail?": "",
  "Is it the tenderloin?": "",
  "Is it the hip?": "",
  "Is it the flank?": "",
  "Huh? Was I wrong?": "",
  "...The opposite! You passed with flying colors!": "",
  "Whew, you almost had me for a second. Don't pause like that!": "",
  "Ah, I apologize. I thought it would fit the mood.": "",
  "Back to the subject at hand, since you've answered everything correctly...": "",
  "We will serve you the legendary kalbi!": "",
  "Aww yeah!": "",
  "Not many customers are grounded enough in beef culture to get through all those questions, you know. Well done!": "",
  "Now please follow me...": "",
  "Thank you for your patronage! We eagerly await your return.": "",
  "(Amazing... That kalbi was really something else...)": "",
  "Ohhh, I'm sorry but that is incorrect! Such a shame.": "",
  "...Crap!": "",
  "Please feel free to try again anytime!": "",
  "Welcome! Before I take your order, may I remind you of our special promotion?": "",
  "You're welcome to try it out today, too!": "",
  "Bro! Just let me eat the goddamn frickin' kalbi meat! I'll pay good money, see? I'm stacked, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> I got stacks!": "",
  "Sir, please understand, our legendary kalbi only goes to the customers who successfully pass our quiz! That's why it's a promotion!": "",
  "Are you shittin' me... I cannot fuckin' believe... What kinda bullshit customer service is this!?": "",
  "Such language! Sir, would you please stop making a scene?": "",
  "(That meathead sure looks heated... Maybe it's time to squash the beef.)": "",
  "Hey, is everything all right?": "",
  "Oh, aren't you... the customer from before...?": "",
  "Hah! Who's this <font_kind=yakuza_italic>lean meat</font_kind> lookin' mofo?": "",
  "I'm having trouble with a... guest. He's demanding to eat our special kalbi.": "",
  "Well? You get all the questions right?": "",
  "Bro, who even cares about that shit!? All I know is that I'm starvin' to death over here for no reason!": "",
  "Rules are rules, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>bro</font_kind>. If you want the kalbi that bad, then why don't you beef up your knowledge?": "",
  "Y-Yes, he's right. After all, this gentleman passed the quiz just fine!": "",
  "What!? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>You</font_kind> ate the special kalbi?": "",
  "Well, yeah.": "",
  "Unbelievable! You... smug son of a bitch!!": "",
  "I need that protein for my workout gains! It's completely wasted on a sausage stick like you!": "",
  "...You know what? You spit that meat out of your mouth right now. Cough that shit up!": "",
  "You gotta be kidding me! There's no way I'm doing that!": "",
  "Then I'll make you throw up the hard way!!": "",
  "Satisfied yet?": "",
  "I... I'm shook, bro. I did everything. I crush weights every day and even went full keto, too... Where did I go wrong?": "",
  "Training your body is fine, but next time try training your mind. Then maybe you can beat the challenge fair and square.": "",
  "I'm... I'm out this bitch...": "",
  "Yes, thanks to you. How about yourself?": "",
  "Hardly a scratch on me.": "",
  "Thank heavens... May I ask your name, sir?": "",
  "Sure. I'm Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami-sama, what you did just now was nothing short of amazing.": "",
  "As my way of saying thanks...": "",
  "You're welcome to order our superior single-cut kalbi anytime you wish.": "",
  "Hey, sounds good to me!": "",
  "It's the least I could do, Yagami-sama.": "",
  "Well, I hope to see you again soon.": "",
  "(All right! It really does pay to lend people a hand every now and then.)": "",
  "Table for one, please.": "",
  "Hey. Excuse me...": "",
  "*sigh* Someday, Miharu-chan... It'll be just you and me.": "",
  "Whoa! ...I mean, welcome, sir! How may I help you?": "",
  "I'm a customer, or at least I'm trying to be. Can you take me to my seat now? I'll have a coffee.": "",
  "Of course... Please, right this way.": "",
  "I apologize for earlier. I'm normally on top of my game. Oh, here's your order.": "",
  "It's fine, but... is everything okay?": "",
  "Well... to be honest, I can't stop thinking about Miharu-chan. So I keep spacing out on customers.": "",
  "Miharu-chan? She your girlfriend or something?": "",
  "Nah, I wish. Her name's Miharu Shima, and she started as a part-timer here pretty recently.": "",
  "Unfortunately, she sees me as just another coworker... Gah, she's totally my type, too...": "",
  "I do get where you're coming from, but I think you should put your job first. That's what pays the bills, right?": "",
  "Yeah, I know... Sorry to bug you with this stuff. As an apology, your order today is on me.": "",
  "Hey, thanks. What's your name?": "",
  "Norimoto.": "",
  "Norimoto-kun, huh? And Miharu-chan. Hopefully you two work out.": "",
  "I hope so too! Thanks again!": "",
  "See you later.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Good to see you, my dude!": "",
  "Well, someone's in a good mood. Oh, and you know what to get me.": "",
  "You bet! Here, let me get you a table!": "",
  "You seem pretty excited about something. Wait... could it be?": "",
  "It is! Thanks to your advice, I'm finally in a relationship with Miharu-chan!": "",
  "Get outta here! You being for real right now?": "",
  "Haha, looks like my catchphrase caught on!": "",
  "In any case, it feels like I'm walking on air right now!": "",
  "Well... that was intentional.": "",
  "Of course! I'll make her the happiest world in the girl!": "",
  "Make sure you take good care of Miharu-chan, all right?": "",
  "Hehehe, for real.": "",
  "Hah, she's got you so excited that you're mixing up your words. Wouldn't hurt to calm down, you know.": "",
  "Now, may I take your order?": "",
  "Hey, thank you. I'll be back again.": "",
  "Thank you so much, Yagami-san. It's on me today.": "",
  "From now on, I'll let you in on a little secret.": "",
  "Sounds awesome. I'll have to try that out sometime.": "",
  "There's a secret employee menu that only we get to order from.": "",
  "But I'll let you order off it lowkey. It's got all the best stuff!": "",
  "Hey, you've got a customer waiting here.": "",
  "Oh! Welcome, sir! Wait, you're...?": "",
  "Yagami, at your service. How've you been, Norimoto-kun?": "",
  "Not bad, I guess. Let me take you to your seat. Right this way, please.": "",
  "So when I came here the other day, Miharu-chan was the one who took care of me.": "",
  "Yeah, and it turns out she's looking for a boyfriend right now.": "",
  "For real!?": "",
  "I also asked what type of guys she's into, and she likes 'em friendly and funny.": "",
  "For real!": "",
  "You're gonna have to do better than saying \"for real\" all the time if you want to get her to notice you.": "",
  "For real...": "",
  "Yes, for real. Agh, I'm telling you, stop saying that.": "",
  "Yes sir...": "",
  "What can I do to make myself more interesting?": "",
  "Well, I'm no pickup artist... But I've developed something I like to call... the YAGAMI System.": "",
  "Y: You are the real prize. A: Ask lots of questions. G: Go for it... A: As soon as you... M: Make her feel comfortable!": "",
  "Last but not least, I: Ignore her calls the next day. Or, if you really like her, I: Invite her out again!": "",
  "Wow, the YAGAMI System's incredible! I'll definitely give it a try! And as thanks, your order today is on me!": "",
  "Now may I take your order?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Awesome!": "เจ๋งมาก!",
  "Aww yeah!": "เย่ส!",
  "Well, yeah.": "ก็... ใช่นะ",
  "See you later.": "แล้วเจอกันใหม่นะ",
  "For real!?": "จริงดิ!?",
  "For real...": "จริงด้วยสิ..."
 }
}
